      "details": "<p><em>Yezd</em>:\u00a0It is a city situated in the district of\u00a0<em>I\u1e63\u1e6da\u1e2br</em> (Istakhr), lying between\u00a0<em>I\u1e63fah\u0101n</em> (Isfahan) and\u00a0<em>Kirm\u0101n</em> (Kerman). And according to some, it is also called\u00a0<em>Yezd\u1e2b\u016br</em>. [translation]</p>",
